  "content": "\n\n<p>FTB Quests 是一款輕量級的團隊合作任務模組，使用起來非常簡單。前往<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdocs.feed-the-beast.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">維基</a>了解更多！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<h4><strong>警告</strong></h4>\n<p>自 FTB Quests 1902.5.0 起，若您希望讓 KubeJS、JEI、REI 或 Game Stages 與 FTB Quests 進行整合，就必須使用 <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ftb-xmod-compat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">FTB XMod Compat</a>。</p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/b1/AOKB8t.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/b1/fsj_Ce.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2>支援</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>若有 <strong>整合包</strong> 相關問題，請前往此處：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fsupport-modpack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://go.ftb.team/support-modpack</a></li>\n<li>若有 <strong>模組</strong> 相關問題，請前往此處：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fsupport-mod-issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://go.ftb.team/support-mod-issues</a></li>\n<li>有任何疑問嗎？歡迎加入我們的 Discord：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fdiscord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://go.ftb.team/discord</a></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>追蹤最新動態</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fdiscord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-discord.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fgithub\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-github.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ftwitter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-twitter-x.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team